    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/445098a9cd4b34ae6f045e0e0cd88ba7.poster.avif?t=1747113637\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/445098a9cd4b34ae6f045e0e0cd88ba7.webm?t=1747113637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/445098a9cd4b34ae6f045e0e0cd88ba7.mp4?t=1747113637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>VolleySmash is a fast-paced 3D volleyball game that delivers intense and fun matches for players of all skill levels.<br>Whether you're a looking for casual gaming or competitive, playing alone or with friends.<br><br>VolleySmash was designed with two main goals in mind, simple and fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/3d4374946b21a6a652d9a43100023236.poster.avif?t=1747113637\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/3d4374946b21a6a652d9a43100023236.webm?t=1747113637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/3d4374946b21a6a652d9a43100023236.mp4?t=1747113637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>-Fast-paced 3D volleyball action<br>-Single-player / Local multiplayer for up to 6 players<br>-Easy-to-learn controls<br>-Focus on strategy and teamwork<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166420/extras/8b2b82bb0800f03d340df30de1d92155.poster.avif?t=1747113637\" w